4,1,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want this trip to be a big adventure! But we should make sure we know the total cost first so there are no surprises later.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Adventure is fine, Rin, but let's not waste half the trip just sitting in transit. I'm looking for efficiency this time.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Rin on the cost. We need a clear financial structure for the bookings to avoid any unfair burdens on a single person.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care about the money as much as the actual setup. If the place is a mess or too cramped, it's going to be a nightmare.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I think it would be useful to look at how we spent our time in previous years to avoid repeating the same mistakes.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if we find a cool house, the travel might be part of the fun! I want to see how much everything costs together.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,Fun is subjective. I'd rather spend my time at the destination than staring at a train station wall.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, the ""setup"" is tied to the budget. We should compare all-in rates against separate bookings to see which is more transparent.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, transparency doesn't fix a bad bathroom or a strict schedule. I want to know exactly how the rooms and meals are handled.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the physical space is one thing, but the psychological space is another. I'm interested in the balance of our time.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm going to check the all-in rates! I want to know the whole price right now.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll handle the logistics. I need to see exactly how much time we're wasting on the way there.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the pricing of offshore houses and the all-in rates. We need a fixed cost structure.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm checking the bathing hours and the meal arrangements. I'm not dealing with a chaotic schedule this year.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the time spent alone last year and how the days actually ran.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
