59,3,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
60,3,1,talk,Rin,,I really want the Island Trip! It sounds like a movie! And the price is one big chunk!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"I'm voting for the City Break. No ferry schedules, no bus deadlines, and we actually get to spend our time *at* the destination.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"The Island Trip is the most financially transparent, but the City Break is acceptable if we use a shared payment app for everything.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm voting for the City Break. I can't deal with the ""one bathroom"" or ""dinner at six"" rules of the other two.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,The City Break is the most logical choice. It prevents the claustrophobia of the house and the isolation of the inn.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, you agree the island is the easiest for money, right? Please vote for the island!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, stop trying to bribe people with ""movie vibes."" We are adults. We want a holiday, not a logistics exercise.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, I prefer the island's payment structure, but I cannot ignore the group's consensus on comfort and time.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, for once, I agree with you. I'm not spending my week counting down the minutes until I can go home.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"The City Break allows us to be a group by choice, rather than by confinement.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,"Aww, you're all being so boring! But I guess if everyone wants the city, I'll go. But I want to know the total cost first!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,We'll figure out the cost. The point is that we won't spend two days of our trip in a waiting room.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"I will insist on a pre-trip budget meeting. If we go with the City Break, we must settle the payment rules before we book.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"As long as I have a room with a door and a bathroom that works, I'm happy.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Toshio,,That seems like a fair compromise.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
